copisteria itself is not distributed in this repository. It is fetched from
the repository above at a pinned commit when decomposer is first run, and
patches/copisteria.patch is applied to that copy. The patch changes
src/copisteria/front.py and src/copisteria/write.py: how staves are grouped
into systems, and how a system that shows fewer staves is matched to the
score's parts.

The copista model weights are downloaded from
https://huggingface.co/kobimusic/copista-28m and are under their own licence;
see the model card there.
